            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The quality and safety of nursing care depends notably on the collection of data. In Quebec, there is a tool which aims to improve the organisation of care in accident and emergency departments. Nurses are on the frontline in the initial assessment of the patient. Unfortunately, their recognition is not on a par with their responsibility.</AbstractText>
